WEBVTT

00:11:59.636 --> 00:12:04.356
The researchers found
that the lifestyle patients

00:12:04.396 --> 00:12:09.516
had a nearly five percent reduction
in coronary plaque.

00:12:09.556 --> 00:12:11.556
Control patients, on the other hand,

00:12:11.596 --> 00:12:16.076
had five percent more
coronary plaque at one year

00:12:16.076 --> 00:12:18.516
and 28 percent more at five years.

00:12:18.516 --> 00:12:22.916
They also had nearly double
the rate of cardiac events,

00:12:22.916 --> 00:12:26.316
like heart attacks,
coronary bypass surgery

00:12:26.356 --> 00:12:28.236
and cardiac-related deaths.

00:12:28.236 --> 00:12:29.836
Now, here's an interesting fact: